Builds the server/website image with migration metadata; optionally pushes it

Usage: leptoskit infra build [OPTIONS] --version <VERSION>

Options:
      --version <VERSION>  Unique immutable image tag
      --push               Push using Docker credentials, or `KAMAL_REGISTRY_PASSWORD` when set
      --reuse-existing     Reuse an existing tag only after checking its migration metadata
  -h, --help               Print help
